出勞軍，即使人鏦殺吳王，盛其頭，馳傳以聞。吳王子子華、子駒亡走閩越。吳王之棄其軍亡也，軍遂潰，往往稍降太尉、梁軍。楚王戊軍敗，自殺。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"楚死事相弟張羽","historicity":"historical_tradition","relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"tae_3uh_xsc","younger_person_id":"fwu_nkh_9qr","operator":"lt","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null,"scope":"siblings","interpretation_status":"source_attested","comparison_basis":"birth_chronology"}},"interpretation_note":"明稱弟張羽，不補楚死事相姓名或共同父母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"張羽","kind":"person","person_id":"fwu_nkh_9qr","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p017","chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji106-010","subject_person_id":"fwu_nkh_9qr","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"tae_3uh_xsc","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p017","quote":"初，吳王之度淮，與楚王遂西敗棘壁，乘勝前，銳甚。梁孝王恐，遣六將軍擊吳，又敗梁兩將，士卒皆還走梁。梁數使使報條侯求救，條侯不許。又使使惡條侯於上，上使人告條侯救梁，復守便宜不行。梁使韓安國及楚死事相弟張羽為將軍，乃得頗敗吳兵。吳兵欲西，梁城守堅，不敢西，即走條侯軍，會下邑。欲戰，條侯壁，不肯戰。吳糧絕，卒饑，數挑戰，遂夜奔條侯壁，驚東南。條侯使備西北，果從西北入。吳大敗，士卒多饑死，乃畔散。於是吳王乃與其麾下壯士數千人夜亡去，度江走丹徒，保東越。東越兵可萬餘人，乃使人收聚亡卒。漢使人以利啗東越，東越即紿吳王，吳王出勞軍，即使人鏦殺吳王，盛其頭，馳傳以聞。吳王子子華、子駒亡走閩越。吳王之棄其軍亡也，軍遂潰，往往稍降太尉、梁軍。楚王戊軍敗，自殺。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"楚死事相弟張羽","historicity":"historical_tradition","relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"tae_3uh_xsc","younger_person_id":"fwu_nkh_9qr","operator":"lt","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null,"scope":"siblings","interpretation_status":"source_attested","comparison_basis":"birth_chronology"}},"interpretation_note":"明稱弟張羽，不補楚死事相姓名或共同父母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji106-029","person_id":"fwu_nkh_9qr","title":"將軍","kind":"office","mode":"